<title>EGYPT: Egypt's export bank results end-Q3 96/7.</title>
<headline>Egypt's export bank results end-Q3 96/7.</headline>
<dateline>CAIRO 1997-06-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results for the first nine months of the financial year 1996/7, which began on July 1.</p>
<p>(All figures in Egyptian pounds, no comparative figures available):</p>
<p> Total assets		  1,941,080,952</p>
<p> Total deposits		  682,026,732</p>
<p> Provisions			146,817,339</p>
<p> Reserves			  103,648,141</p>
<p> Shareholders funds	    172,648,141</p>
<p> Distributable profits	  27,828,072</p>
<p>(Full name is Export Development Bank of Egypt)</p>
<p>$1 =3.395 pounds</p>
<p>-- Cairo newsroom +20 2 578 3290/1</p>
</text>
